<title>MONACO: SOCCER-GRASSI LEAVES MONACO FOR SION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GRASSI LEAVES MONACO FOR SION.</headline>
<dateline>MONACO 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss international Marco Grassi has been transferred from Monaco to Sion of Switzerland, the French champions said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The forward, who still had two years to run on his Monaco contract, signed for two years for Sion. Monaco would not say what the transfer fee was.</p>
<p>Bordeaux midfielder Stephane Ziani signed a four-year contract with fellow French first division club Lens. The transfer fee was 12 million francs ($2.2 million).</p>
</text>
